        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 936RT, Clear Glass Knob with Rectangle Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFrom the new <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Hardware</b></a> collection this round clear glass knobset is the perfect way to make a statement about your sense of clean style. It exudes contemporary elegance and a quiet grace that can add a touch of class to any door. It is paired with a rectangle back plate that does not take away from the beauty of the contemporary clear door knob. The Omnia 936RT clear glass door knobset is available in 7 finishes choices.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 936RT Clear Door Knob with Rectangle Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 936RT Clear Door Knob with Rectangle Plates:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rectangle Rose Plate Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rectangle Rose Plate Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 knob, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary knob for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clear Door Knob with Rectangle Plate, Omnia 936RT",
                "description": "From the new Omnia Prodigy Hardware collection this round clear glass knobset is the perfect way to make a statement about your sense of clean style. It exudes contemporary elegance and a quiet grace that can add a touch of class to any door. Paired with a rectangle back plate that does not take away from the beauty of the contemporary clear door knob.  The Omnia 936RT clear glass door knobset is available in 7 finishes choices.",
                "keywords": "OMN-936RT Clear Door Knob with Rectangle Plate, Omnia 936RT clear glass knobsets Rectangle plates, omnia prodigy collections, modern crystal door knobs,  passage knobs, privacy knobs, vintage knobs, square Glass Knobs, contemporary glass knobs, clear Glass Knob With Rectangle Roses, Omnia Clear Glass Knobsets,"
